    modelAnswer: `Original: Uzbekistan attracted $10 billion in foreign direct investment in 2023. Paraphrase 1: Foreign direct investment reaching $10 billion flowed into Uzbekistan in 2023. Paraphrase 2: A total of $10 billion in FDI was attracted by Uzbekistan in 2023. Paraphrase 3: The year 2023 saw Uzbekistan attract investments totalling $10 billion in FDI.`,
