    "1️⃣ B2 GRAMMATIKA TAKRORI — YUQORI DARAJALI TUZILMALAR\n\nINVERSION:\n  Never have I seen such dedication.\n  Not only did she pass, but she also won the prize.\n  Hardly had I sat down when the phone rang.\n  Only by working hard can you succeed.\n\nCLEFT SENTENCES:\n  It was John who called. / What he needs is more time.\n\nADVANCED PASSIVE:\n  The report is believed to have been submitted.\n\nNOMINALIZATION:\n  decided to invest → decision to invest\n  developed the plan → development of the plan",
    "2️⃣ CONDITIONALS TAKRORI\n\nTYPE 2: If I were you, I would reconsider.\nTYPE 3: If she had studied harder, she would have passed.\n\nMIXED:\n  If I had studied medicine (past), I would be a doctor now (present).\n\nSUBJUNCTIVE:\n  I suggest that he be informed immediately.\n  It is essential that this be addressed.\n\nFORMAL (without if):\n  Were I to resign, the company would face difficulties.\n  Had she known, she would have acted differently.\n  Should any problems arise, contact us immediately.",
